1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,400
Your AI agent just onboarded half a customer. Six steps done, then billing died. Who undoes the other five?

2
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:25,839
REVERSA turns plain words into a strict plan, only over systems you authorized. Every effect previewed. Every risk flagged. Billing touches money, so it needs your approval.

3
00:00:25,839 --> 00:00:37,879
Ten real actions across five systems. And REVERSA never assumes, it re-checks every effect. Green means verified, not attempted.

4
00:00:37,879 --> 00:00:50,479
Now watch it break. One click kills billing mid-run. REVERSA detects it instantly, blocks everything downstream, nothing half-built escapes.

5
00:00:50,479 --> 00:01:06,900
Then it heals itself. Seven completed steps, undone in reverse order, each one verified gone. The workspace is deleted. The users are archived. Nothing left to clean up.

6
00:01:06,900 --> 00:01:21,120
Every run seals a hash-chained Evidence Passport, fifty-nine events you can verify offline. All of it on one Vultr VM. REVERSA: reversible where possible, accountable everywhere.

7
00:01:21,120 --> 00:01:25,120
REVERSA: reversible where possible, accountable everywhere.
